# Base image for every FROM in infrastructure/docker/Dockerfile: the Docker Official Image python:3.14.10-slim-trixie
# (CPython 3.14.10 on Debian 13), by index digest, the same pin as the Cloud Assessor App. The website and the AddOns moved
# on to python:3.15.2; this repository stays on Python 3.14 and is moved by hand. The Dockerfile does not read this file:
# it repeats the digest in full on each FROM line, and nothing in CI compares the two, so this file is documentation and
# the two must be changed together by hand. The tag beside the digest is documentation; Docker resolves the digest.
# Plain shell assignments, read by /bin/sh.
# Resolved on 2026-11-07 from Docker Hub: python:3.14.10-slim-trixie and python:3.14-slim-trixie both pointed at the
# digest below (3.14.10 was the newest 3.14 patch; no 3.14.11 tag existed). To move it, resolve the new digest with
# `docker buildx imagetools inspect python:3.14-slim-trixie`, change this file and both FROM lines of the Dockerfile
# together, and run `bash scripts/scan-image.sh` (the weekly image scan, image-scan.yml, also runs on a pull request
# that touches this folder).
PYTHON_IMAGE=python:3.14.10-slim-trixie
PYTHON_IMAGE_DIGEST=sha256:af8a5aa14780025dbfbcfbc81bd8a91ebd87711dd5b0f48ed71090949dd7cb1d
PYTHON_VERSION=3.14.10
